\section{Frozen hypothesis and isolated change}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

All arms retain the exact 3,611,849-parameter history-linear shortcut model:
\[
  \widehat y=y_{\mathrm{latest}}+
  \delta_{\mathrm{deep}}+\delta_{\mathrm{history\ shortcut}}.
\]
Only the maximum optimization duration changes: 3, 6, 9, or 12 epochs.
The frozen no-shortcut run remains the decision baseline. No data, input,
width, initialization, objective, or uncertainty-head change is permitted.

