This single-fold, single-seed convergence screen cannot establish seasonal
robustness, transfer, or a champion. Only a longer-duration arm passing every
frozen condition may retain its exact architecture for the unchanged rolling
protocol. If all three longer durations fail, the convergence family closes
without confirmation release.

